{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20955","headline":"崇义里滞雨 · 李贺","name":"崇义里滞雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落莫谁家子，来感长安秋。\n壮年抱羁恨，梦泣生白头。\n瘦马秣败草，雨沫飘寒沟。\n南宫古帘暗，湿景传签筹。\n家山远千里，云脚天东头。\n忧眠枕劒匣，客帐梦封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}